      "message": "test(post): bore tests follow current main (refusal, decimal goldens, fixture field) (#1445)\n\nReview fix. The app bore fixture gets break_through: None. The post\nbore test now pins the by-name refusal of heidenhain, tinyg and carvera\n(no spindle stop before the rapid retract) instead of an expanded chain.\nThe Heidenhain golden is removed. The fanuc and haas goldens are\nregenerated with decimal points. The decision record follows.\n\nRefs #1445\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
